# "Some professional basketball players are not American nationals."
pro_bb_player(some_pbp_1). @ "Some professional basketball players"
not american(some_pbp_1). @ "are not American nationals"
pro_bb_player(V) => jump_shot(V). @ "All professional basketball players can do jump shots."
jump_shot(V) => leaps_up(V). @ "If someone can jump shots, they leap straight into the air."
leaps_up(V) => activates_legs(V). @ "If someone leaps straight into the air, they activate their leg muscles."
not activates_legs(yuri). @ "Yuri does not activate his leg muscles."
? american(yuri).
